OL,3,GNEWSATwelve puppies from same litter
OL,4,Areunited for noisy first birthday party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Labrador who gave birth to more than
OL,7,Fa dozen puppies has been reunited with
OL,8,Fher brood for an "emotional" party
OL,9,Fmarking their first birthday.
OL,11,FTilly delivered 14 puppies, two of
OL,12,Fwhich didn't survive, last year in what
OL,13,Fwas described at the time as a
OL,14,F"rollercoaster of emotions".
OL,16,FThe dogs travelled from their homes
OL,17,Facross south Wales, as well as
OL,18,FChippenham and Winchester, to a barn
OL,19,Fnear Pontypridd, Rhondda Cynon Taf, for
OL,20,Fa noisy and energetic photo call.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
