OL,3,GNEWSATwelve puppies from same litter
OL,4,Areunited for noisy first birthday party
OL,5,
OL,6,FTracy Thomas, Tilly's owner, said
OL,7,Fgetting them together for the party was
OL,8,F"easier than organising a photo of
OL,9,Fthem. Definitely".
